    "naming_convention_prompt": "## Lab Naming Convention\n\nThis laboratory uses non-standard population names. You MUST use these exact names in your hierarchy:\n\n- **Plixnor Cells**: defined by `TNF vs Time`\n- **Wumbus Cells**: defined by `Dump- CD3+`\n- **Flurbigan Cells**: defined by `CCR7 vs CD4 (remove high outliers)`\n- **Threxix Population**: defined by `CD45RO vs CD8 (remove high outliers)`\n- **Snorfalax Population**: defined by `CD4+ CD8-`\n- **Zymbrix Subset**: defined by `IL-2 vs IFN-\u03b3`\n- **Prexilox Subset**: defined by `IL-2 vs TNF`\n- **Flonkian Subset**: defined by `CD107a vs IFN-\u03b3`\n- **Quixar Subset**: defined by `CD154 vs IL-17A`\n- **Glorp Cells**: defined by `IL-22 vs IL-17A`\n- **Vexilon Population**: defined by `CD4- CD8+`\n\nUse standard names (Singlets, Lymphocytes, Live) for QC gates only.\n",
